+// Legacy clients predict their own cycle between authoritative syncs. A
+// zero-speed cycle therefore creeps forward when CYCLE_SPEED_DECAY_BELOW is
+// positive, then snaps back on every freeze sync. The network configuration
+// protocol can send a setting to one peer, so suppress only that peer's
